            "en": "Hudhayfa ibn al-Yaman, back from Armenia, worried about differences in recitation between the soldiers of Syria and Iraq. 'Uthman had the sheets kept by Hafsa copied by a committee led by Zayd ibn Thabit, sent a copy to each major province and had the other copies withdrawn."
