            "en": "'Ali fought at Badr, Uhud, the Trench and in almost every expedition. At Khaybar (7 AH), the Prophet ﷺ announced the night before: \"Tomorrow I will give the flag to a man with whose leadership Allah will grant victory.\" The next day he called 'Ali, who had an eye ailment, prayed for him and handed him the flag."
